      "message": "Agreed on the blast radius. Change 3\u0027s validator rejects invalid files on every write through Gerrit, and v1 is the first version that reads ai-review/, so rejecting `paths` (as asked in https://review.gerrithub.io/c/GerritForge/ai-review-agent-provider/+/1255196/comment/02f837ef_d5d54abf/) cannot invalidate an existing file. Files written around the validator could still take down every descendant, so an invalid file now hides only its own action, logged, and never brings back an inherited or built-in one (PS5).",
